 *📅*** **DAY:** ***Every*** ***Wednesday***\n\n* **🕡 Time: 6:30 PM 
 – 8:45 PM** ⏰\n\n**Please register ASAP** **if you want to attend on S
 ept 3rd so we can save your spot!**\n\n*We had roughly 80 people sign up f
 or the last two events... but we only have space for 30 people max.*\n**\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-**\n**After registering\, please do the
  following on Sept. 3rd :**\n\n1. **✅ Do your best to arrive on time @ C
 afé Princess (6:30 PM)**\n2. **✅ Tell us whether you want to focus on l
 earning/practicing ENGLISH or KOREAN**\n3. **✅ Tell us your level: Begin
 ner\, Intermediate\, Advanced or Expert**\n4. **✅** **Buy 1 item from th
 e Café Princess Menu** (This is the only cost if this is your 1st or 2nd 
 class. There is an additional $3 fee if this is your third class)\n\n**\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-**\n**✨ Popular menu items include:**\n\n* ***🍓 Straw
 berry Cheesecake Bingsu***\n* ***🍧 Mango or Oreo Bingsu***\n* ***☕ Ma
 tcha & Tiramisu Lattes***\n* ***🧇 Princess Waffles with Ice Cream & Muc
 h More***\n\n**###** **What to Expect**\n\n* ***🇰🇷 Guided Korean & E
 nglish language practice***\n* ***📚 Interactive mini-lesson led by an a
 ward-winning certified teacher***\n* ***🗣️ Structured conversation ac
 tivities with native and fluent speakers***\n* ***🎲 Board games and soc
 ial activities to practice language naturally***\n* ***🤝 Make new frien
 ds while improving your communication skills***\n\n👨‍🏫 **MEET YOUR
  TEACHER & HOST**\n**###** **Learn From an Expert Language Teacher**\n\n**
 *John Dias (OCT\, PhD researcher\, MA\, BEd\, HBA & EELC) is an award-winn
 ing certified language teacher with 10+ years experience***\n\n**###** **W
 ho Should Attend?**\n\n* ***English learners (ESL)***\n* ***Native Korean 
 speakers wanting to practice English***\n* ***Korean learners of all level
 s***\n* ***International students\, newcomers\, professionals\, and anyone
  interested in language and culture***\n\n**Feel free to** 📧 **e-mail [
 info@tilelearning.com](mailto:info@tilelearning.com) if you have any quest
 ions.**\n**Check out our** 🌐 **[website](https://www.tilelearning.com/)
  and [instagram](https://www.instagram.com/tilelearning/) accounts for mor
 e details.**
